[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    218[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // Row 9 — negative discriminant is clamped to +0.0f (no domain error)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    219[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
